--- !u!114 &2060270043
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2060270035}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a61b94b7e96e4a84c9f60476197ea7c1, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  panel: {fileID: 2103514439}
  titleText: {fileID: 236934461}
  bodyText: {fileID: 545078395}
  descriptions:
  - mode: 0
    text: 'A secret target time is chosen - you won''t see it.

      When the timer
      starts, press your button whenever you think the moment is right.

      Whoever
      presses closest to the target time wins the round - being early or late doesn''t
      matter, only how close you are'
  - mode: 1
    text: "At the start of each round, one of you is randomly picked to set the time
      - this role alternates every round.\r\nIf it's your turn to set the time:\r\nPress
      your button once to start the count, then press it again whenever you want
      to end it. That gap becomes the secret target - your opponent doesn't know
      how long it was.\r\nIf it's your turn to guess:\r\nWatch and listen for your
      opponent's two presses (a beep plays for each one), remember the gap between
      them, then press your button once at the moment you think that same amount
      of time has passed since the timer started.\r"
  - mode: 2
    text: 'A secret target time is chosen - you won''t see it.

      You and your
      teammate each press your own button once. Your two press times get added together.

      If
      the combined total lands close enough to the target, you both win the round.
      You can''t see when your teammate presses - talk it out, or trust your gut'
  loadingText: Loading mode description...
  inputGraceTime: 0.3
